{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"OESA-2026-2162","published":"2026-05-03T09:56:50Z","modified":"2026-05-03T10:19:21.322886Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-35469"],"summary":"kubernetes security update","details":"Container cluster management.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA flaw was found in the SPDY streaming code used by Kubelet, CRI-O, and kube-apiserver. An attacker with specific cluster roles, such as those allowing access to pod port forwarding, execution, or attachment, or node proxying, could exploit this vulnerability. This could lead to a Denial of Service (DoS) by causing the affected components to become unresponsive.(CVE-2026-35469)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"kubernetes","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/kubernetes&distro=openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["kubernetes-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","kubernetes-client-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","kubernetes-help-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","kubernetes-kubeadm-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","kubernetes-kubelet-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","kubernetes-master-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","kubernetes-node-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm"],"src":["kubernetes-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["kubernetes-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","kubernetes-client-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","kubernetes-help-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","kubernetes-kubeadm-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","kubernetes-kubelet-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","kubernetes-master-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","kubernetes-node-1.20.2-30.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-2162.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kubernetes","ecosystem":"openEuler:22.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/kubernetes&distro=openEuler-22.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.20